# Manifold level 2
# The corridor (stage 3h): where the camera has walls behind it. A tunnel with a ceiling, a turn to the
# right into a trench open to the sky, another turn into a second tunnel, and a room at the end. Behind
# the character there is a wall or a ceiling most of the way: the camera comes in in front of them at
# once, and goes back out slowly. And two zones say where to look, along the way the corridor goes.
title Corridor
spawn 0 1 6
facing 0 0 -1

# The floors: the courtyard, the first tunnel and its turn, the trench, the second tunnel, the room.
box 0 -0.5 5.5     3 0.5 3.5     color #6f6a62  name courtyard
box 0 -0.5 -3.05   1.3 0.5 5.05  color #6f6a62
box 3.6 -0.5 -6.8  2.3 0.5 1.3   color #6f6a62
box 7.2 -0.5 -10.75  1.3 0.5 5.25  color #6f6a62
box 7.5 -0.5 -19.5   4.5 0.5 3.5   color #6f6a62  name room

# The walls, 4.5 m high, the way 1.6 m wide between them.
box -1.05 2.25 -3.05  0.25 2.25 5.05  color #8a7a66
box 1.05 2.25 -2      0.25 2.25 4     color #8a7a66
box 2.8 2.25 -7.85    3.6 2.25 0.25   color #8a7a66
box 4.9 2.25 -5.75    3.6 2.25 0.25   color #8a7a66
box 8.25 2.25 -11     0.25 2.25 5     color #8a7a66
box 6.15 2.25 -12.05  0.25 2.25 3.95  color #8a7a66

# The ceilings of the two tunnels, 3 m up between the walls (the trench between them has none).
box 0 3.25 -2.8   0.8 0.25 4.8  color #5a5048  name ceiling
box 7.2 3.25 -11  0.8 0.25 5    color #5a5048

# Where to look: along the trench, from its turn on (+X); along the second tunnel (−Z).
sensor camera  2.8 1 -6.8   3.6 1 0.8  view 1 0 0   name along_trench
sensor camera  7.2 1 -11    0.8 1 5    view 0 0 -1  name along_tunnel
sensor goal    7.5 0.8 -20  3 0.8 2

# The void under it all.
sensor fall    4 -6 -7      30 3 30
